USBIDS.DAT is made by tools/mkpciids.py from the list of USB IDs (usb.ids; http://www.linux-usb.org/usb-ids.html),
maintained by Stephen J. Gowdy. The list's contents may be distributed under either the GNU General Public
License (version 2 or later) or the 3-clause BSD License; GLOS uses it under the 3-clause BSD License, below.
USBIDS.DAT holds the list's vendors and devices (no interfaces, no classes) and its header's lines, packed with
deflate. The source: http://www.linux-usb.org/usb.ids, list version 2026.06.26 (fetched 2026-11-22), usb.ids
sha256 f5a48b0cc8dae1607c2f0bae6b8dc13f2ecef69dbeaeaf34b4be8e280d34dba4.

